OL,3,GNEWSARunner who came last in marathon
OL,4,Apraises support
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe final runner to cross the finish
OL,7,Fline in the Jersey Marathon has praised
OL,8,Fthe "amazing" support she received.
OL,10,FAgata Rutkowska completed the 26.2 mile
OL,11,F(42km) course in six hours and 55
OL,12,Fminutes on Sunday.
OL,14,FShe was cheered on by crowds as she
OL,15,Fcame to the end of her challenge, which
OL,16,Fbrought her to tears.
OL,18,F"I did cry to be honest because the
OL,19,Fsupport there was so amazing," she
OL,20,Fsaid. "I didn't expect that."
